{
  "version": 8,
  "name": "Papercraft",
  "metadata": {
    "description": "Manhattan cut from paper: the water in three sheets stepping down from the shore, the water's mask eroded twice; the land a cream sheet with rough-cut edges and its streets cut into it as grooves; the parks a green sheet on it, the buildings little blocks on that; each sheet casting a soft shadow, its mask moved and blurred, on what lies beneath; over a paper grain."
